  "m4.quiz.q_cookie_03_e3": "Wi-Fi irratti kuukii wal-jijjiiruun hin jiru.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01": "Matadureen 'X-Frame-Options: DENY' (ykn frame-ancestors none) fayyadamtoota akkamitti eega?",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_o1": "Marsariitii biraa keessatti akka iframe hin taane gochuun weerara Clickjacking ittisa.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_o2": "Fayyadamtoonni iskiriin akka hin kaafne dhorka.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_o3": "Viidiyoo bilbila irratti daawwachuu cufa.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_e1": "Clickjacking fayyadamtoota sobuun qabduu akka dhiiban godha; kanaan fuulli ifatti qofa banama.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_e2": "Iskiriin kaasuun sirna bilbilaatiin to'atama malee mataduree kanaan miti.",
  "m4.quiz.q_xfo_01_e3": "Viidiyoo fuula irratti banamu irratti dhiibbaa hin qabu.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01": "Garaagarummaan bu'uuraa CORS fi Content Security Policy (CSP) gidduu jiru maaliidha?",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_o1": "CORS dubbisa API kallattii biraa to'ata; CSP immoo qabiyyee fuula ammaa irratti fe'amu to'ata.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_o2": "CORS bilbilaaf, CSP kompiitaraaf qofa.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_o3": "CORS networkii cophsa, CSP immoo ergaa gadi xiqqeessa.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_e1": "CORS daangaa API laaffisa; CSP immoo balaa koodii naqamuu ittisuuf daangaa cimaa kaa'a.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_e2": "Ulaagaaleen lameen Browser-oota hunda irratti walqixa hojjetu.",
  "m4.quiz.q_cors_01_e3": "Cophsuun hojii TLS ti malee CORS ykn CSP miti.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01": "Laabii M4 keessatti, senariyoon DS-A (demo-a.example) maaliif 'Eegumsa Dabalataa Barbaada' jedhame?",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_o1": "TLS qabaatus, ce'umsa HTTPS, HSTS, CSP fi kuukii eegame waan hin qabneef fi sarvarii waan saaxiluuf.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_o2": "Sababa weerarri DDoS irratti gaggeeffamaa jiruuf.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_o3": "Sababa galmeessi DNS isaa yeroon darbeef.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_e1": "DS-A cufaa TLS qabaachuun qofti matadureewwan eegumsaa malee gahaa akka hin taane agarsiisa.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_e2": "Laabiin kun qindaa'ina mataduree qora malee dambalii DDoS miti.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsa_01_e3": "DS-A guutummaatti ni hojjeta; hanqinni isaa mataduree eegumsaati.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01": "Laabii M4 keessatti, hanqinni xiqqaan DS-B qabxii guutuu akka hin arganne godhe maaliidha?",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_o1": "TLS, ce'umsa, HSTS, CSP fi kuukiin cimanis, mataduree 'Permissions-Policy' gahaa hin qabu.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_o2": "Waraqaan ragaa TLS isaa haqameera.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_o3": "Jecha iccitii database sarvarii irratti cophsuu dadhabe.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_e1": "DS-B qabxii 7 keessaa 6 argachuun sadarkaa cimaarra jira; Permissions-Policy qofatu hafe.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_e2": "Waraqaan ragaa DS-B kan hojjetuudha.",
  "m4.quiz.q_dsb_01_e3": "M4 eegumsa HTTP qora malee qindaa'ina database keessoo miti.",
